  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This task is to change the body of a 404 response from the current low-level text to what was found in Fedora 5.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently, if a resource localhost:8080/test does not exist, the 404 body is:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "```",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Error: org.fcrepo.persistence.api.exceptions.PersistentItemNotFoundException: info:fedora/test ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "```",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This text could be improved by changing it to:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "```",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resource at /text not found",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "```",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "..and if the resource used to exist, and a tombstone is there now:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "```",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Discovered tombstone resource at /test, departed: 2020-03-26T14:42:19.747-04:00",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "```",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
