  "description": "<p>This task is to change the body of a 404 response from the current low-level text to what was found in Fedora 5.</p>\n\n<p>Currently, if a resource localhost:8080/test does not exist, the 404 body is:<br/>\n```<br/>\nError: org.fcrepo.persistence.api.exceptions.PersistentItemNotFoundException: info:fedora/test <br/>\n```</p>\n\n<p>This text could be improved by changing it to:<br/>\n```<br/>\nResource at /text not found<br/>\n```<br/>\n..and if the resource used to exist, and a tombstone is there now:<br/>\n```<br/>\nDiscovered tombstone resource at /test, departed: 2020-03-26T14:42:19.747-04:00<br/>\n```</p>",
